msg.en:
Praise God in his holy house of worship,
praise him under the open skies;
Praise him for his acts of power,
praise him for his magnificent greatness;
Praise with a blast on the trumpet,
praise by strumming soft strings;
Praise him with castanets and dance,
praise him with banjo and flute;
Praise him with cymbals and a big bass drum,
praise him with fiddles and mandolin.
Let every living, breathing creature praise GOD!
Hallelujah!

msg.es:
Alaben a Dios en su santa casa de adoración,
alábenlo bajo el cielo abierto;
alábenlo por sus actos de poder,
alábenlo por su magnífica grandeza;
alábenlo con un potente toque de trompeta,
alábenlo pulsando suavemente las cuerdas;
alábenlo con castañuelas y danza,
alábenlo con banjo y flauta;
alábenlo con címbalos y un gran bombo,
alábenlo con violines y mandolina.
¡Que toda criatura viviente, todo ser que respira, alabe a DIOS!
¡Aleluya!
